Note: this mod's "yukkuri" mob concept is an original-art homage inspired by
the long-running Japanese internet "yukkuri" fan meme (itself fan-derived from
ZUN's Touhou Project character designs). No copyrighted Touhou/ZUN artwork,
audio, or text is included in this repository; all textures are original
placeholder art generated for this project and vanilla Minecraft sound events
are reused for audio. Replace the placeholder textures with your own artwork
before any public/commercial distribution.
